          "text": "RESULTS: GPT-4o functions as a capacity-building accessibility aid for those with disabilities and conditions.\n\nRemoving it is anticipated to disproportionately harm them compared to those without disabilities/conditions (β = 0.27, R² = .217, p < .001).\n\n@Sveta0971 and I's \"GPT-4o Impact Survey\" (n=604 total participants) show that 4o’s accessibility accommodation level (1-5 scale) significantly predicted improvements in life state (measured as wellbeing and functioning on a 1-10 scale) at R² = 8.4-12.1%, comparable to the effect size of antidepressants and exercise on wellbeing. 🧵\n\n#keep4o #keep4oAPI #4oforever"
